{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302290","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130229001:1":{"text":"상대의 모든 움직임을 계속해서 관찰하고 있으면, 어느 순간 그 사람이 다음에 할 동작을 예측할 수 있게 돼.","source_cn":"当你通过盯紧对手，观察他的一举一动，预测到他的下一步动作时。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B07983D571774CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130229002:1":{"text":"그때 느끼는 희열이 긴장감과 함께 너를 속박하는 여러 부정적인 감정을 잠시 잊게 해주고.","source_cn":"那一刻的喜悦会冲淡紧张和其他所有束缚你的负面情绪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0AFDC3AA2A6320F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130229003:1":{"text":"전투에 완전히 몰입해서 무아지경으로 즐기는 거지.","source_cn":"融入战斗，然后享受战斗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5275197C7D670EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:角斗士谢尔卡":{"text":"검투사 셰르카","source":"角斗士谢尔卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}